OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSome clear
OL,6,Fspells to start before low cloud and
OL,7,Fmist develops across many parts of the
OL,8,Fregion during Saturday evening.
OL,9,FTurning foggy across some areas, and
OL,10,Fthis will be dense with winds
OL,11,Fremaining light.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FA duller day with mist and fog
OL,14,Fslow to clear. Possibly brighter early
OL,15,Fafternoon, but increasing chance of
OL,16,Fdrizzly rain reaching Norfolk in the
OL,17,Fevening. This clearing to showers
OL,18,Fovernight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
