OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FA mix
OL,6,Fof sunny spells and cloudy periods,
OL,7,Fwith showers at times. A moderate to
OL,8,Ffresh breeze. Temperatures around or
OL,9,Fjust below average for the time of
OL,10,Fyear.
